# Ecommerce Data Science Project

## Project Overview
This project analyzes e-commerce retail sales data to identify sales trends, top-performing products, customer purchasing patterns, and business opportunities.

## Dataset
The project uses the Online Retail dataset containing transaction details such as invoice numbers, product descriptions, quantities, unit prices, customer IDs, dates, and countries.

## Tools & Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Google Colab

## Project Work
- Data inspection and cleaning
- Missing-value and duplicate analysis
- Sales calculation and analysis
- Product and country-level analysis
- Monthly sales trend visualization
- Customer analysis
- Basic sales forecasting
- Business insights and recommendations

## Key Deliverables
- Jupyter Notebook containing the analysis and visualizations
- Cleaned sales dataset exported as CSV

## Conclusion
This project demonstrates practical data cleaning, exploratory data analysis (EDA), visualization, and business-oriented insights using Python.

